    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d425">

                <pb facs="0420" n="410" sameAs="frus:frus1941v06/pg410"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">824.796/175: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Bolivia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Jenkins</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">La
                                Paz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-08-02T11:00:00-04:00">August 2, 1941—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 1:29 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>191. Referring to my telegram No. 188, August 1, 4 p.m.<anchor n="22"
                        xml:id="d425-f1"/> Cabinet last night unanimously approved and the President
                    and Ministers concerned signed decrees authorizing Panagra’s management
                    contract, new LAB charter by-laws, postal contract and operations contract. Also
                    issued a decree redistributing shares in accordance with Rocha’s<anchor n="26"
                        xml:id="d425-f2"/> report outlined in my despatch No. 942 of July 14.<anchor
                        n="22" xml:id="d425-f3"/> Minister of Finance is issuing orders to
                    reorganizing commission to buy in German shares immediately at 500 bolivianos,
                    using cash on hand.</p>
                <pb facs="0421" n="411" xml:id="pg411"/>
                <p>Documents are now being prepared on official paper and it is hoped that all will
                    be signed on Monday,<anchor n="27" xml:id="d425-f4"/> at which time the loan
                    agreement may presumably be considered in effect.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jenkins</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
